        "description": "**Second Map Out Now with New Mode, New Special Abilities and more**\n\nTHIS IS NOT THE MAIN GAME. Full experience: meta.com/experiences/6847023095354894\n\n**Discord**: discord.gg/2G6Mb6UC3v\n\n\n# 🏰 Solo/Multiplayer Adventure in Mysterious Mansion\nA multiplayer game that combines strategic gameplay and exploration. Mysterious creature lurk within the mansion, and legends suggest that knowing its name grants control over it. Brave souls like you must form a team of three, delve deep into the shadow and uncover the creature's name for rich rewards.\n{2122697684780894}\n\n# 🕸 Immersive Gameplay\nUse 7 sacramentals, solve challenging puzzles and reveal each sin. Solo or 3-player co-op with real-time voice chat for seamless social experiences. Friendlist invite makes social hangout easier.\n{391738560189539}\n\n# 🏃 Chase mode\nOnce your sanity runs out, creatures will initiate chase mode. Escape and find out it's name before your sanity drained.\n\n# 🙀 Shop System\nComplete your tasks in each run to earn coins which let you buy skins and items in the store. ",
